Cases with ids beginning `jts-` are derived from that suite's
`test_parsing/` files: the file name becomes the case id, the file's
bytes become the case input, and the y_/n_/i_ prefix becomes the
expectation (accept / reject / either). Cases with ids beginning
`json-` or `ijson-` are original work, written against the cited RFC
section, and are covered by this repository's MIT license.
